<title>USA: U.S. soymeal weekly export sales highlights--USDA.</title>
<headline>U.S. soymeal weekly export sales highlights--USDA.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-10-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. soybean meal major sales activity in the week ended Oct 3 reported by exporters for the following purchasing countries, in tonnes:</p>
<p>Net Sales:     1996/97		 1997/98</p>
<p> Unknown	  55,000		   Nil</p>
<p> China	    50,000</p>
<p> Indonesia	28,000</p>
<p> Thailand	 27,500</p>
<p> Ecuador	  25,000</p>
<p>A total of 221,500 tonnes in sales were outstanding on Sept 30 and carried over to 96/97. Exports of 34,300 tonnes for Sept 27-30 brought accumulated exports to 4,291,600 tonnes for the 95/96 marketing year, off 10 percent from 4,767,700 tonnes in 94/95.</p>
<p>Shipments for Oct 1-3 of 6,800 tonnes were primarily to Canada (4,800) and Mexico (1,500)</p>
</text>
